  "description": "RoboSystems-authored calculation arcs encoding FAC's BS/IS/CF accounting identities (BS1-5, IS1-11, CF1-6). 22 rules rendered as ~51 summationOf arcs between fac primitives and aggregates. Each rule is materialized as a Structure so users see which identity an arc belongs to. RoboSystems-native artifact \u2014 the FAC identities themselves are derived from Charlie Hoffman's documentation, but the JSON-LD serialization is ours.",
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@id": "_:fac-calc-bs1",
      "roleUri": "http://www.xbrlsite.com/seattlemethod/conceptual-model/cm-roles/roles/fac-calculations/BS1",
      "structureName": "FAC BS1 \u2014 Equity = Parent + Noncontrolling",
      "structureType": "balance_sheet"
    },
    {
      "@id": "_:fac-calc-bs2",
      "roleUri": "http://www.xbrlsite.com/seattlemethod/conceptual-model/cm-roles/roles/fac-calculations/BS2",
